422.description:
Received if the CLM upgrade cannot be processed.
Possible reasons:
- machine has no communication unit assigned;
- communication unit of the machine is not `CLM light`;
- machine has not been activated (and so has no contract);
- machine's contract isn't active or canceled;
- there is another contract change request pending for the machine.
- tariff change was done this month.

Received if the contract hosting plan cannot be changed.
Possible reasons:
- machine has no communication unit assigned;
- machine has not been activated (and so has no contract);
- machine's contract isn't active or canceled;
- machine isn't a CLM Light;
- there is another contract change request pending for the machine;
- contract end date is too close.

